# The build context is the repository root, so everything not needed to compile is excluded.
# Copying bin/ and obj/ in would also overwrite the container's build output with host artifacts
# built for a different runtime identifier.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/TestResults/
**/artifacts/

.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
# Signalboard links these approved public captures into its runtime static assets. Keep every
# other documentation input out of the image context.
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/images/
docs/images/**
!docs/images/lakewright-social-preview.png
!docs/images/signalboard-dashboard.png
!docs/images/signalboard-viewer-denied.png
!docs/images/signalboard-other-tenant.png
databricks/
scripts/
tests/

**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/compose.yaml
**/*.md
**/*.user
**/node_modules/
